BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 509.50 Tm (Q: How does your privacy scrubber work, and what are its limitations?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 498.00 Tm (Answer:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 486.50 Tm (FinancialPrivacyScrubber uses 6 compiled regular expressions to mask standard patterns for Emails, Indian PAN cards) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 475.00 Tm (\([A-Z]{5}[0-9]{4}[A-Z]{1}\), 12-digit Aadhaar-formatted numbers, Bank Account numbers following account keywords, 16-digit) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 463.50 Tm (Credit Cards, and 10-digit Indian phone numbers, replacing them with tokens like [PAN_01].) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 452.00 Tm (Its limitation is that regex matching only detects strings conforming to those exact syntactic patternsñit will not catch) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 440.50 Tm (unformatted account numbers, person names, or physical addresses, nor does /api/v1/audit/parse-raw perform optical OCR on) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 429.00 Tm (scanned PDF images. In a production system, we would pair regex rules with a transformer-based Named Entity Recognition) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 417.50 Tm (\(NER\) service such as Microsoft Presidio.) Tj ET
